": "Institute of Computational Biology, Helmholtz Zentrum München, German Research Center for Environmental Health, Neuherberg, Germany."}]}}, {"fullName": "Theis FJ", "lastName": "Theis", "firstName": "Fabian J", "initials": "FJ", "authorId": {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-2419-1943"}, "authorAffiliationDetailsList": {"authorAffiliation": [{"affiliation": "Institute of Computational Biology, Helmholtz Zentrum München, German Research Center for Environmental Health, Neuherberg, Germany fabian.theis@helmholtz-muenchen.de."}, {"affiliation": "Department of Mathematics, Technische Universität München, Garching bei München, Germany."}]}}]}, "authorIdList": {"authorId": [{"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0001-7464-7921"}, {"type": "ORCID", "value": "0000-0002-2419-1943"}]}, "dataLinksTagsList": {"dataLinkstag": ["altmetrics", "supporting_data", "recommended_reviews"]}, "journalInfo": {"issue": "6", "volume": "15", "journalIssueId": 2827307, "dateOfPublication": "2019 Jun", "monthOfPublication": 6, "yearOfPublication": 2019, "journal": {"medlineAbbreviation": "Mol Syst Biol", "title": "Molecular systems biology", "essn": "1744-4292", "issn": "1744-4292", "nlmid": "101235389", "isoabbreviation": "Mol Syst Biol"}, "printPublicationDate": "2019-06-01"}, "pubYear": "2019", "pageInfo": "e8746", "abstractText": "Single-cell RNA-seq has enabled gene expression to be studied at an unprecedented resolution. The promise of this technology is attracting a growing user base for single-cell analysis methods. As more analysis tools are becoming available, it is becoming increasingly difficult to navigate this landscape and produce an up-to-date workflow to analyse one's data. Here, we detail the steps of a typical single-cell RNA-seq analysis, including pre-processing (quality control, normalization, data correction, feature selection, and dimensionality reduction) and cell- and gene-level downstream analysis. We formulate current best-practice recommendations for these steps based on independent comparison studies. We have integrated these best-practice recommendations into a workflow, which we apply to a public dataset to further illustrate how these steps work in practice. Our documented case study can be found at https://www.github.com/theislab/single-cell-tutorial This review will serve as a workflow tutorial for new entrants into the field, and help established users update their analysis pipelines.", "affiliation": "Institute of Computational Biology, Helmholtz Zentrum München, German Research Center for Environmental Health, Neuherberg, Germany.", "publicationStatus": "epublish", "language": "eng", "pubModel": "Electronic", "pubTypeList": {"pubType": ["Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't", "review-article", "Review", "Journal Article"]}, "grantsList": {"grant": [{"agency": "Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft", "grantId": "Subproject A17", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Silicon Valley Community Foundation", "grantId": "182835", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Helmholtz Association", "grantId": "ZT‐I‐0007", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Bundesministerium für Bildung und Forschung", "grantId": "01IS18053A", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Bundesministerium für Bildung und Forschung", "grantId": "01IS18036A", "orderIn": 0}, {"agency": "Deutsche Forschungsgemeinschaft", "grantId": "1243", "orderIn": 0}]}, "meshHeadingList": {"meshHeading": [{"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Gene Expression Profiling", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "MT", "qualifierName": "methods"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Sequence Analysis, RNA"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Internet"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Guidelines as Topic"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Workflow"}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "Single-Cell Analysis", "meshQualifierList": {"meshQualifier": [{"majorTopic_YN": "Y", "abbreviation": "MT", "qualifierName": "methods"}]}}, {"majorTopic_YN": "N", "descriptorName": "High-Throughput Nucleotide Sequencing"}]}, "keywordList": {"keyword": ["computational biology", "Single‐cell Rna‐seq", "Analysis Pipeline Development", "Data Analysis Tutorial"]}, "subsetList": {"subset": [{"code": "IM", "name": "Index Medicus"}]}, "fullTextUrlList": {"fullTextUrl": [{"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "pdf", "site": "Unpaywall", "url": "https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/pdfdirect/10.15252/msb.20188746"}, {"availability": "Subscription required", "availabilityCode": "S", "documentStyle": "doi", "site": "DOI", "url": "https://doi.org/10.15252/msb.20188746"}, {"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "html", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC6582955"}, {"availability": "Open access", "availabilityCode": "OA", "documentStyle": "pdf", "site": "Europe_PMC", "url": "https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC6582955?pdf=render"}]}, "isOpenAccess": "Y", "inEPMC": "Y", "inPMC": "Y", "citedByCount": 1943, "hasReferences": "Y", "hasTextMinedTerms": "Y", "hasDbCrossReferences": "N", "hasPDF": "Y", "hasBook": "N", "hasSuppl": "Y", "hasLabsLinks": "Y", "hasData": "Y", "license": "cc by", "authMan": "N", "epmcAuthMan": "N", "nihAuthMan": "N", "hasTMAccessionNumbers": "Y", "tmAccessionTypeList": {"accessionType": ["doi"]}, "dateOfCompletion": "2020-04-30", "dateOfCreation": "2019-06-21", "dateOfRevision": "2024-07-17", "electronicPublicationDate": "2019-06-19", "firstPublicationDate": "2019-06-19", "firstIndexDate": "2019-06-24", "fullTextReceivedDate": "2025-02-04", "hasEvaluations": "N"}]}}